static const char _zs221_d[] = "reserved member name\n\nA type body declares a member named `lock`, `take`, `borrow`, `release`, `private` or `public`. These are ownership/access markers in member position and cannot be declared. Rename the member; the visibility declarations `public:`/`private:` naming a unit block remain valid.";
